name mathcommand
category Package
revision 59512
shortdesc \newcommand-like commands for defining math macros
longdesc This package provides functionalities for defining macros that
longdesc have different behaviors depending on whether in math or text
longdesc mode, that absorb Primes, Indices and Exponents (PIE) as extra
longdesc parameters usable in the code; and it offers some iteration
longdesc facilities for defining macros with similar code. The primary
longdesc objective of this package is to be used together with the
longdesc knowledge package for a proper handling of mathematical
longdesc notations.
